{"page":418,"verses":[{"verse_key":"33:1","surah":33,"ayah":1,"ar_uthmani":" يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّبِىُّ ٱتَّقِ ٱللَّهَ وَلَا تُطِعِ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ وَٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ ۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ كَانَ عَلِيمًا حَكِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Prophet, be mindful of God and do not give in to the disbelievers and the hypocrites: God is all knowing, all wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O Prophet","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"33:1"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","en_gloss":"O Prophet","transliteration":"l-nabiyu","verse_key":"33:1"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱتَّقِ","en_gloss":"Fear","transliteration":"ittaqi","verse_key":"33:1"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"33:1"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"33:1"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تُطِعِ","en_gloss":"obey","transliteration":"tuṭiʿi","verse_key":"33:1"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","verse_key":"33:1"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ ۗ","en_gloss":"and the hypocrites","transliteration":"wal-munāfiqīna","verse_key":"33:1"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"33:1"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"33:1"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"33:1"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلِيمًا","en_gloss":"All-Knower","transliteration":"ʿalīman","verse_key":"33:1"},{"pos":13,"ar":"حَكِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"All-Wise","transliteration":"ḥakīman","verse_key":"33:1"},{"pos":14,"ar":"١","en_gloss":"(1)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:1"}]},{"verse_key":"33:2","surah":33,"ayah":2,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱتَّبِعْ مَا يُوحَىٰٓ إِلَيْكَ مِن رَّبِّكَ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ كَانَ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ خَبِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Follow what your Lord reveals to you: God is well aware of all your actions.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱتَّبِعْ","en_gloss":"And follow","transliteration":"wa-ittabiʿ","verse_key":"33:2"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"33:2"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُوحَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"is inspired","transliteration":"yūḥā","verse_key":"33:2"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"33:2"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"33:2"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَّبِّكَ ۚ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"33:2"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"33:2"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"33:2"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"33:2"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"33:2"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"you do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"33:2"},{"pos":12,"ar":"خَبِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"All-Aware","transliteration":"khabīran","verse_key":"33:2"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢","en_gloss":"(2)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:2"}]},{"verse_key":"33:3","surah":33,"ayah":3,"ar_uthmani":"وَتَوَكَّلْ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ ۚ وَكَفَىٰ بِٱللَّهِ وَكِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Put your trust in God: God is enough to trust.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَتَوَكَّلْ","en_gloss":"And put your trust","transliteration":"watawakkal","verse_key":"33:3"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"33:3"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"33:3"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَكَفَىٰ","en_gloss":"And Allah is sufficient","transliteration":"wakafā","verse_key":"33:3"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"And Allah is sufficient","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"33:3"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَكِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) Disposer of affairs","transliteration":"wakīlan","verse_key":"33:3"},{"pos":7,"ar":"٣","en_gloss":"(3)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:3"}]},{"verse_key":"33:4","surah":33,"ayah":4,"ar_uthmani":"مَّا جَعَلَ ٱللَّهُ لِرَجُلٍ مِّن قَلْبَيْنِ فِى جَوْفِهِۦ ۚ وَمَا جَعَلَ أَزْوَٰجَكُمُ ٱلَّـٰٓـِٔى تُظَـٰهِرُونَ مِنْهُنَّ أُمَّهَـٰتِكُمْ ۚ وَمَا جَعَلَ أَدْعِيَآءَكُمْ أَبْنَآءَكُمْ ۚ ذَٰلِكُمْ قَوْلُكُم بِأَفْوَٰهِكُمْ ۖ وَٱللَّهُ يَقُولُ ٱلْحَقَّ وَهُوَ يَهْدِى ٱلسَّبِيلَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God does not put two hearts within a man’s breast. He does not turn the wives you reject and liken to your mothers’ backs into your real mothers; nor does He make your adopted sons into real sons. These are only words from your mouths, while God speaks the truth and guides people to the right path.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"Allah (has) made","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah (has) made","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِرَجُلٍۢ","en_gloss":"for any man","transliteration":"lirajulin","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَلْبَيْنِ","en_gloss":"two hearts","transliteration":"qalbayni","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":8,"ar":"جَوْفِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"his interior","transliteration":"jawfihi","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":10,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"He (has) made","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَزْوَٰجَكُمُ","en_gloss":"your wives","transliteration":"azwājakumu","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلَّـٰٓـِٔى","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"allāī","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تُظَـٰهِرُونَ","en_gloss":"you declare unlawful","transliteration":"tuẓāhirūna","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مِنْهُنَّ","en_gloss":"[of them]","transliteration":"min'hunna","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أُمَّهَـٰتِكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"(as) your mothers","transliteration":"ummahātikum","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":17,"ar":"جَعَلَ","en_gloss":"He has made","transliteration":"jaʿala","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أَدْعِيَآءَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your adopted sons","transliteration":"adʿiyāakum","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أَبْنَآءَكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"your sons","transliteration":"abnāakum","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ذَٰلِكُمْ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālikum","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":21,"ar":"قَوْلُكُم","en_gloss":"(is) your saying","transliteration":"qawlukum","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":22,"ar":"بِأَفْوَٰهِكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"by your mouths","transliteration":"bi-afwāhikum","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":23,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"but Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":24,"ar":"يَقُولُ","en_gloss":"says","transliteration":"yaqūlu","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱلْحَقَّ","en_gloss":"the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqa","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":27,"ar":"يَهْدِى","en_gloss":"guides","transliteration":"yahdī","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":28,"ar":"ٱلسَّبِيلَ","en_gloss":"(to) the Way","transliteration":"l-sabīla","verse_key":"33:4"},{"pos":29,"ar":"٤","en_gloss":"(4)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:4"}]},{"verse_key":"33:5","surah":33,"ayah":5,"ar_uthmani":"ٱدْعُوهُمْ لِـَٔابَآئِهِمْ هُوَ أَقْسَطُ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ ۚ فَإِن لَّمْ تَعْلَمُوٓا۟ ءَابَآءَهُمْ فَإِخْوَٰنُكُمْ فِى ٱلدِّينِ وَمَوَٰلِيكُمْ ۚ وَلَيْسَ عَلَيْكُمْ جُنَاحٌ فِيمَآ أَخْطَأْتُم بِهِۦ وَلَـٰكِن مَّا تَعَمَّدَتْ قُلُوبُكُمْ ۚ وَكَانَ ٱللَّهُ غَفُورًا رَّحِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Name your adopted sons after their real fathers: this is more equitable in God’s eyes––if you do not know who their fathers are [they are your] ‘brothers-in-religion’ and proteges. You will not be blamed if you make a mistake, only for what your hearts deliberately intend; God is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱدْعُوهُمْ","en_gloss":"Call them","transliteration":"id'ʿūhum","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِـَٔابَآئِهِمْ","en_gloss":"by their fathers","transliteration":"liābāihim","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَقْسَطُ","en_gloss":"(is) more just","transliteration":"aqsaṭu","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عِندَ","en_gloss":"near","transliteration":"ʿinda","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَعْلَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"you know","transliteration":"taʿlamū","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ءَابَآءَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their fathers ","transliteration":"ābāahum","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَإِخْوَٰنُكُمْ","en_gloss":"then (they are) your brothers","transliteration":"fa-ikh'wānukum","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلدِّينِ","en_gloss":"[the] religion","transliteration":"l-dīni","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَمَوَٰلِيكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"and your friends","transliteration":"wamawālīkum","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَلَيْسَ","en_gloss":"But not is","transliteration":"walaysa","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":17,"ar":"جُنَاحٌۭ","en_gloss":"any blame","transliteration":"junāḥun","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فِيمَآ","en_gloss":"in what","transliteration":"fīmā","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":19,"ar":"أَخْطَأْتُم","en_gloss":"you made a mistake","transliteration":"akhṭatum","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":20,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":22,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":23,"ar":"تَعَمَّدَتْ","en_gloss":"intended","transliteration":"taʿammadat","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":24,"ar":"قُلُوبُكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"your hearts","transliteration":"qulūbukum","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":25,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":26,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":27,"ar":"غَفُورًۭا","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūran","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":28,"ar":"رَّحِيمًا","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīman","verse_key":"33:5"},{"pos":29,"ar":"٥","en_gloss":"(5)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:5"}]},{"verse_key":"33:6","surah":33,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ أَوْلَىٰ بِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ مِنْ أَنفُسِهِمْ ۖ وَأَزْوَٰجُهُۥٓ أُمَّهَـٰتُهُمْ ۗ وَأُو۟لُوا۟ ٱلْأَرْحَامِ بَعْضُهُمْ أَوْلَىٰ بِبَعْضٍ فِى كِتَـٰبِ ٱللَّهِ مِنَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَٱلْمُهَـٰجِرِينَ إِلَّآ أَن تَفْعَلُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰٓ أَوْلِيَآئِكُم مَّعْرُوفًا ۚ كَانَ ذَٰلِكَ فِى ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ مَسْطُورًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Prophet is more protective towards the believers than they are themselves, while his wives are their mothers. In God’s Scripture, blood-relatives have a stronger claim than other believers and emigrants, though you may still bestow gifts on your proteges. All this is written in the Scripture.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","en_gloss":"The Prophet","transliteration":"al-nabiyu","verse_key":"33:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَوْلَىٰ","en_gloss":"(is) closer","transliteration":"awlā","verse_key":"33:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"to the believers","t